<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104913" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐετ-ηρίς</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>triennial festival,</i> i. e. <i>celebrated every third
				year</i> (inclusively), =
			<i>in alternate years,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				6.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.258
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				262
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				51.27
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				299.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				331.8
			</span></i> (both Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).730.15
			</span></i> (Camirus, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>): pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				133
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				834e
			</span></i>; in full, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἑορταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					4.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδος</span>) <i>cycle</i> or <i>period
				of three (two) years,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Hom.
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1308b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).155.50
			</span></i> (Rhodes, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.69.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ὧραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					54.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες τ.</span>”
				<i>celebrating the triennial festival,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.235
				</span></i>
			.</div>
